    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You need to take the transcript below and break it down. You need to get a summary for both parties, you need to break down the action items for Ross to do, and you need to organize the homework/action items for the other party in the call. \n\nContext: We are going to send an email to Ross with the tactical summary of how the call went, what went well, what could have gone better, and action items for the next steps to take. We are also going to take a summary out for the other person on the call, give them a summary that hits their pain points with Ross's solution as the way to go, as well as homework for them to get done (if any was talked about)\n\nYou will include the title of the call for context:\n{{ $('Google Drive Trigger').item.json.name }}\n\nTranscript from the call:\n{{ $('Google Drive Trigger').item.json.exportLinks['text/html'] }}\n\nYou will output this in a professional HTML format that is easy to get a tactical breakdown that will be sent via gmail.",
